/* ===== USAGE NOTES ===== */

/*
1. TRIGGER: Add onclick="openModal()" to any button/link to open the modal
2. BACKDROP CLICK: Clicking outside the modal closes it automatically
3. ESCAPE KEY: Press ESC to close the modal
4. PREVENT SCROLL: Body scroll is disabled when modal is open
5. ACCESSIBILITY: Include aria-label on close button for screen readers
6. MULTIPLE MODALS: Use different IDs for multiple modals on same page
7. VALIDATION: Add HTML5 validation attributes (required, pattern, etc.)
*/